msgid ""
"Example: Remote transpilation with Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-"
"transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example walks you through creating and adding to a program file that, "
"when you upload it to Qiskit Serverless, will transpile a `circuit` against "
"a given `backend` and target `optimization_level`.\n"
msgstr ""

